<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian meat exports rise in Oct 96 - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian meat exports rise in Oct 96 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for October 1996 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> October 96    5,441     153	     7,392	5,267</p>
<p> September 96  5,297     148	     6,238	4,229</p>
<p> October 95    5,823     107	     6,185	4,882</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> October 96   56,086	410	   4,678	 711</p>
<p> September 96 46,773	423	   3,439	 554</p>
<p> October 95   63,670    1,009	   5,874	 652</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
